},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_62","text":"... What makes you think that?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_63","text":"I doubt the type of people who frequent Ephialtes will appreciate someone barging in and looking for someone.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_64","text":"Whoa, you're right. I've thought this before, but you're way sharper than I expected.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_65","text":"Hehe, as should any character who wears glasses!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_66","text":"People flock to Ephialtes for the thrills, sure,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_67","text":"but what really reels 'em in is the airtight secrecy.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_68","text":"You can bare even your most depraved urges in there, and not a whisper ever gets out.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_69","text":"Just like you said, if we just waltz in and start asking for someone's whereabouts...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_70","text":"Well, that's practically begging for a fight with everything Ephialtes' all about.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_71","text":"Even for someone from the Exotic Squad? I thought you guys were idolized over there.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_72","text":"Of course it's possible. Not just because I'm part of Exotic, but also because I've got connections.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_73","text":"I've already put in a word, so once we meet up with them, we can get things started.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_74","text":"We can't get caught, but if we do it all sneaky-like, it should be fine. ♡","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_75","text":"Are you sure we'll be okay?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_76","text":"We've got the Commando Unit on our side, so what's there to worry about?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_77","text":"No, I mean for you guys.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_78","text":"Isn't there like... some kind of back-alley code you guys follow? Can you just break it like that?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_79","text":"Ahaha! You're worried about us?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_80","text":"Don't be! We're totally fine. Exotic's jurisdiction has been expanded exponentially.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_81","text":"It has?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_82","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_82","text":"Yep! Our original mission was mostly espionage in the Outer Rim.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_83","text":"But now, it's all about keeping the Outer Rim stable. Because of that, our authority got a serious upgrade too.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_84","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_84","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_85","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_85","text":"Viper fiddles with her choker.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_86","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_86","text":"We're stuck inside the Outer Rim, but oh well...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_87","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_87","text":"So, shall we get going?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_88","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_88","text":"All right, I'm counting on you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_89","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_89","text":"Are we going on our own? The Boss isn't coming with us?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_90","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_90","text":"She's so smart! And super helpful.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_91","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_91","text":"Of course she'll be joining us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_92","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_92","text":"Did you say \"boss\"?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_93","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_93","text":"Yeah.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_94","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_94","text":"Aren't you the leader of the Exotic Squad?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_95","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_95","text":"Hehe, nope.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_96","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_96","text":"Could it be...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_97","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_97","text":"Nope, it's not that either, so don't worry.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_01_98","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_01_98","text":"A new leader has been appointed to the Exotic Squad.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}